# Drawbridge compose interpolation pin — DELIBERATELY EMPTY (plan D13).
#
# Every `docker compose` invocation passes `--env-file <this file>` so that:
#   * no variable interpolation ever happens from a project-directory .env
#     that a business repository might ship;
#   * business secrets keep flowing exclusively through the administrator's
#     compose template `env_file:` directives, which Drawbridge never reads.
#
# Install at <paths.config_dir>/compose/empty.env
# (standard deployment: /etc/drawbridge/compose/empty.env — this exact file).
# drawbridge-init-config generates it inside the skeleton's compose/ dir;
# drawbridge-selfcheck (runner role) and release_preflight both verify it.
